# Description: Detects Powershell as a child of the WmiPrvSE process. Which could be a sign of lateral movement via WMI.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((Image:*\\powershell.exe OR Image:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((OriginalFileName:"PowerShell.EXE" OR OriginalFileName:"pwsh.dll"))) AND (ParentImage:*\\WmiPrvSE.exe))
